# Sonarly (Go) is the only server. This dev compose example was retired when
# the TypeScript server was removed; production-shaped deployment lives in
# docker/compose.yaml.example.
# Local development: see docs/development.md — run the Go server with
# `go run ./cmd/sonarly` from server/ and the web client with `pnpm dev` from
# web/ (vite proxies /api and /rest to localhost:3000).
